# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Beyond Good & Evil (55530018), classifier-path benchmark (#433): drive
# generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself once play is
# confirmed. Action-adventure: walk forward, turn, interact/attack -- never
# START.
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2.0
    axis LX max
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.0
    axis LX min
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    mash A 2 0.3
    wait 1.5
}
